{"id": "68282", "title": "陌陌谦行", "author": "锦紫苏", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 30, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68282.htm", "intro": "婚礼上，新娘挠挠头说：“其实……我暗恋他十多年……”\r\n\r\n宾客一片哗然，太执着了！\r\n\r\n男人们羡慕地看着新郎，心说：哥们儿，太幸运了，要是这么个女人，掏心掏肺地对我，不出一年，我就举白旗了。还是您狠，楞是坚持了十多年不投降，不愧是成功人士，定力够强!\r\n\r\n这时，无辜的新郎也开口了：“其实……我也暗恋她十多年……”\r\n\r\n哗！台下震惊了！这是什么个乌龙？暗恋游戏？也不能玩十几年吧！这俩都什么人啊？难怪能凑一块儿！\r\n\r\n本文男主女主男配女配这个呸那个呸，通通都是超长情的怪物。本文温馨有爱，不虐，如果你还相信爱情，那就大胆点击吧！", "base": "files/article/html/68/68282", "chapters": [{"title": "一", "file": "10524149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二", "file": "10524150.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三", "file": "10524151.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四", "file": "10524152.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五", "file": "10524153.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六", "file": "10524154.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七", "file": "10524155.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八", "file": "10524156.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九", "file": "10524157.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十", "file": "10524158.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十一", "file": "10524159.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十二", "file": "10524160.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十三", "file": "10524161.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十四", "file": "10524162.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十五", "file": "10524163.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十六", "file": "10524164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十七", "file": "10524165.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十八", "file": "10524166.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十九", "file": "10524167.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十", "file": "10524168.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十一", "file": "10524169.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十二 既相逢，却匆匆", "file": "10524170.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十三 乌龙相亲", "file": "10524171.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十四 解不开的结", "file": "10524172